एक pron. a. [इ-कन्]
1 One,
single, alone, only;

. {3} the
wife of the same man; a co-wife;
सर्वासामेकपत्नीनामेका चेत्पुत्रिणी भवेत्

. {2} fixing the mind
upon one object, closely attentive;
एकमनाः श्रोतुमर्हति देवः

. {4}
solely or exclusively devoted (to
one); अबलैकरसाः

.
--रूप a. {1} of one
form or kind, like, similar;

 v. l. {2}
close-standing, standing side by
side;

एकक a.
1 Single, alone, solitary,
without a co-adjutor;

एकतस् ind.
1 From one side, on
one side.
--2 Singly, one by one;
एकतः --अन्यतः on one side-on the
other side;

;
एकतः, -एकतः on the one side-on
the other side; Ś. 4. 2.
